# TIN TROOP 2-B, start to finish with plain button presses (recorded once
# from a route plan). The first soldier catches fire at the candle and runs
# into the pen: the mice he touches catch fire and spread it to the rest
# before he burns away. The second lets the toy dragon's breath light him,
# burns the dragon on the way past, and puts himself out in the pool.
game tintroop
wait 5
cheat unlock
press A
wait 5
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 5
wait 129
hold RIGHT 192
wait 5
hold RIGHT+A 16
hold RIGHT 13
hold RIGHT+A 20
hold RIGHT 44
wait 116
hold RIGHT 101
wait 22
hold RIGHT+A 22
wait 1
hold RIGHT 44
wait 1
hold RIGHT+A 22
wait 1
hold RIGHT 192
wait 1
hold RIGHT 15
hold RIGHT+A 30
hold RIGHT 233
hold RIGHT+A 2
wait 1
hold RIGHT+A 24
wait 5
hold RIGHT 4
hold RIGHT+A 32
hold RIGHT 307
expect state == 4
expect best_4 == 11
expect kills == 5
